受救援治疗者按复合策略计为无应答，单纯停用随机治疗者采用治疗策略，缺失数据通过多重插补处理。本研究不开展期中分析。安全性分析基于安全性集，按实际治疗进行分析。样本量计算依据非劣效界值-12个百分点、预期两组ACR20应答率均为60%、单侧α=0.025、把握度90%、1:1随机并考虑15%失访，计划约520例受试者。","rationale":"主要非劣效判定、分析集策略、估计目标、样本量假设和主要终点有已确认研究事实支持。医学经理需核实统计分析详细方法、缺失数据插补模型和敏感性分析安排。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、期中分析、样本量、非劣效界值）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_a0c5e662a8b06173","section_number":"9.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:1c038989dc1bd44b2124ba0c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5acd10ce8e436","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6112e50bcd74ec"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922160422_471138c1","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE、SAE及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征和心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"b7b07260763ae74db57a2516bf63ca4452202b7f5fee51482cc73ab6c3900d25","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_study_def_5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：严重感染和机会性感染。","quote_sha256":"6302f18a206c03dd2ae646047c50b7523046872adfc22232db7036d4fe2c60dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_study_def_6"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"全分析集与符合方案集共同支持主要非劣效结论；以组间ACR20率差的双侧95%置信区间下限高于-12%判定非劣效。不开展期中分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。","quote_sha256":"80316d430b7ac17d825207ff7e2ffa16bbe5db6a959c02af8e289190f2073c19","so