要求。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_crf_review_version","missing_source_classes":["病例报告表设计文件","数据管理计划"],"target":"10.1 病例报告表"},{"action":"明确病例报告表填写、修改和源数据核对要求。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_crf_completion","missing_source_classes":["病例报告表设计文件","数据管理计划"],"target":"10.1 病例报告表"}],"heading":"病例报告表","missing_source_classes":["病例报告表设计文件","数据管理计划"],"proposal_text":"本研究病例报告表应依据方案规定的访视流程和评价时点设计，覆盖筛选期、双盲双模拟治疗期24周及安全性随访期4周的数据采集。病例报告表需记录支持主要终点第24周ACR20应答率、关键次要终点第24周DAS28-CRP较基线变化和第24周ACR50应答率、其他次要终点第12周ACR20应答率，以及安全性终点TEAE、SAE及导致停药的不良事件发生率和实验室检查、生命体征和心电图具有临床意义的变化所需的信息。病例报告表内容应与统计分析需求一致，并保证所记录数据可溯源、准确和完整。","rationale":"访视策略、研究时期、疗效终点和安全性终点有已确认研究事实支持，支持病例报告表需覆盖的数据范围。医学经理需核实病例报告表形式、设计审核、版本控制和填写修改要求。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_508c9b9b70da5439","section_number":"10.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:1c038989dc1bd44b2124ba0c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5acd10ce8e436","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6112e50bcd74ec"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"63cf7279d88e234d2ac28c4e9542fa3f80009557c7978ec296ed2cb91461c82b","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_b209d029cdd23382:full-draft:1c038989dc1bd44b2124ba0c","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:1c038989dc1bd44b2124ba0c","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:defc9b2a5fb939bebce57c9f1eb47eb7b7a5651124c6cd0f737697349c57cfb1:1c038989dc1bd44b2124ba0c","text_sha256":"63cf7279d88e234d2ac28c4e9542fa3f80009557c7978ec296ed2cb91461c82b"},{"content